{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c47b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae2e-304f-7791-b344-a738da145935"},"sequence":152,"recorded_at":1780531400000299,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"3f9b309c-9633-41a9-b30f-c2d9c31c28f3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"3f9b309c-9633-41a9-b30f-c2d9c31c28f3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"3f9b309c-9633-41a9-b30f-c2d9c31c28f3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ae2e-90ef-7150-8cc1-867642054cfd"},"task_id":"01a0ae2e-90ef-7150-8cc1-867642054cfd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ae2e-90ef-7150-8cc1-867642054cfd","chunk":"Read text file `internal/sessrepo/lease.go`.\n1|// Lease Record attestation for the session-persistence leaf.\n2|//\n3|// Lease Records (urn:ax:schema:lease) are session-persistence objects\n4|// alongside Session Records and Session Events. This helper owns their\n5|// canonical identity attestation through the canonicaljson owner, so\n6|// query-layer admission (internal/sessquery) never attests the binding\n7|// itself: it calls AttestLeaseRecord and then extracts the already\n8|// validated members. The lease store's mint path confirms through the\n9|// same funnel, keeping this file the leaf's only direct Verify caller\n10|// for lease objects. The provhost identity bound allowlists this site\n11|// with the three session record/event sites.\n12|package sessrepo\n13|\n14|import (\n15|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/canonicaljson\"\n16|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/scalar\"\n17|)\n18|\n19|// AttestLeaseRecord validates one canonical Lease Record frame through\n20|// the canonicaljson owner and returns its canonical digest with the\n21|// self-identity field. Closed-shape and self-identity failures are\n22|// returned for the caller to map to its refusal class.\n23|func AttestLeaseRecord(raw []byte) (scalar.Digest, canonicaljson.SelfField, error) {\n24|\treturn canonicaljson.VerifyObjectIdentity(raw)\n25|}","final_result":true}}}
