{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c4f1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae2e-304f-7791-b344-a738da145935"},"sequence":211,"recorded_at":1780531400000417,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"3f9b309c-9633-41a9-b30f-c2d9c31c28f3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"3f9b309c-9633-41a9-b30f-c2d9c31c28f3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"3f9b309c-9633-41a9-b30f-c2d9c31c28f3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ae2e-a6fd-7262-8efd-f511608b04fc"},"task_id":"01a0ae2e-a6fd-7262-8efd-f511608b04fc","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ae2e-a6fd-7262-8efd-f511608b04fc","chunk":"Read text file `internal/fencing/terminate.go`.\n1|package fencing\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/scalar\"\n5|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/sessrepo\"\n6|)\n7|\n8|// AuthorizeTerminateStale gates the terminal backend terminate-stale\n9|// operation: terminate a process only for explicit force recovery\n10|// after preserving diagnostics, and only when the target is fenced\n11|// (its token is not the winning tuple). The caller needs no winning\n12|// grant of its own: the stale-process host runs this during force\n13|// recovery. A nil error authorizes the termination; any refusal names\n14|// the Section 4.C terminate-stale row class\n15|// (local_precondition_failed) or the fencing class that applies.\n16|//\n17|// Arm order is precedence: malformed calls die first, then the\n18|// authority to judge staleness (an established, well-formed winner),\n19|// then the explicit force recovery confirmation with its preserved\n20|// diagnostics, then the target binding, then the live-owner guard.\n21|func AuthorizeTerminateStale(presented PresentedToken, winner sessrepo.LeaseSummary, hasWinner bool, forceRecovery bool, diagnosticsPreserved bool) error {\n22|\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(presented.SessionID); err != nil {\n23|\t\treturn refuse(ErrInvalidArguments, \"terminate-stale target session %q is not a UUIDv7: %v\", presented.SessionID, err)\n24|\t}\n25|\tif presented.Epoch == 0 {\n26|\t\treturn refuse(ErrInvalidArguments, \"terminate-stale target carries epoch 0, want an epoch at or above 1\")\n27|\t}\n28|\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv4(presented.LeaseID); err != nil {\n29|\t\treturn refuse(ErrInvalidArguments, \"terminate-stale target lease %q is not a UUIDv4: %v\", presented.LeaseID, err)\n30|\t}\n31|\tif !hasWinner {\n32|\t\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \"terminate-stale cannot prove its target is fenced without an established winning lease\")\n33|\t}\n34|\tif winner.Epoch == 0 || !validLeaseID(winner.LeaseID) {\n35|\t\treturn refuse(ErrInvalidArguments, \"terminate-stale observation carries no well-formed winning lease\")\n36|\t}\n37|\tif !forceRecovery {\n38|\t\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \"terminate-stale requires explicit force recovery\")\n39|\t}\n40|\tif !diagnosticsPreserved {\n41|\t\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \"terminate-stale requires preserved diagnostics before termination\")\n42|\t}\n43|\tif presented.SessionID != winner.SessionID {\n44|\t\treturn refuse(ErrLeaseConflict, \"terminate-stale target for session %s is not fenced by the winning lease for session %s\", presented.SessionID, winner.SessionID)\n45|\t}\n46|\tif presented.Epoch == winner.Epoch && presented.LeaseID == winner.LeaseID {\n47|\t\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \"terminate-stale must not terminate the live winning owner at epoch %d\", winner.Epoch)\n48|\t}\n49|\treturn nil\n50|}","final_result":true}}}
